{"channelId":"UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","row":["Lansing Community College",1130,"Lansing Community College is one of the largest community colleges in Michigan, serving more than 13,000 students each year. It offers more than 200 degree and certificate programs with online, in-person, hybrid and hy-flex class formats, in addition to career and workforce development and personal enrichment options for learners of all ages. \n\nThe college was founded in 1957 and has since grown from its flagship campus in downtown Lansing to include locations in Delta Township, East Lansing and Mason. LCC is consistently named one of Michigan's best community colleges, and students enjoy unsurpassed instruction, beautiful facilities, cutting-edge technology and comprehensive support services to help them succeed.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:15.704Z","channelId":"UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"de516876f274bd81833b4df5fcb72935992d511f31ddc0431740c7916f217998","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8179af5fa7fa16c615582e6d8805e8d15df8564761cc7892173a2c5f1b299aa1"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1130,"raw":"1.13K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCooBEHa6gWTqCNkumznO-vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:15.704Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"exclude","code":"general_institution","reason":"综合学校／职业平台／综合演讲内容，未确认专门领域主体。","keywords":[],"